      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear the deep frustration in your words, and it makes total sense that you feel like standard advice has become a situation that doesn't match your reality. When healing feels like an endless loop rather than progress, it's easy to lose faith in the whole process. Please know that your feelings of being \"broken\" or the pointlessness of the struggle are valid reactions to an incredibly difficult experience, not signs that you are failing.",
      "source": "target",
